WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.286 --> 00:00:07.602
The parade through the crowded city continued. It seemed as if all of London had come to welcome

2
00:00:07.603 --> 00:00:15.436
the new monarch. However, Tom, the boy who would soon be crowned king, sat lifelessly on his magnificent

3
00:00:15.437 --> 00:00:22.433
horse. His eyes stared vacantly at his surroundings, and his mouth was turned down as he rode

4
00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:32.091
along. "Your Majesty!" Hertford rode up next to him and whispered furiously in his ear. "Lift up your

5
00:00:32.092 --> 00:00:38.008
