19
00:02:13.683 --> 00:02:24.104
through the crowd. Finally he was near the entrance to the abbey. His heart sank. Royal guards

20
00:02:24.105 --> 00:02:29.769
were blocking the doorway and forcing the ordinary folk to stand back. Edward ran along the side of

21
