the abbey until he came to another, smaller entrance. Just then the door opened and several guards stepped

22
00:02:34.083 --> 00:02:44.577
out. "Luck is with me!" Edward thought, for at that same moment, the procession was approaching the main

23
00:02:44.578 --> 00:02:50.575
entrance, and the guards all turned to stare in wonder. Edward slipped past them unseen into the

24
00:02:50.576 --> 00:02:59.157
vast coolness of the abbey. What a sight greeted him! Already the pews were almost filled with nobles

25
00:02:59.158 --> 00:03:05.791
