the soaring windows. To help the spectators see, a raised platform with steps had been placed at the

27
00:03:12.712 --> 00:03:20.466
front of the abbey. A magnificent throne sat there now. Edward quickly crept behind a huge stone

28
00:03:20.467 --> 00:03:28.863
