00:04:15.081 --> 00:04:21.737
to walk up the steps of the platform toward the archbishop. He was instructed to kneel on a

37
00:04:21.738 --> 00:04:32.581
velvet cushion, and as the archbishop recited holy verses from an ancient scroll, a bishop held the crown

38
00:04:32.582 --> 00:04:39.883
on another pillow. Finally the archbishop lifted the crown of England and held it over Tom's head. Tom

39
