47
00:05:58.237 --> 00:06:08.262
a foot. "Do not touch that boy!" he shouted. "For he is Edward, your king!" No one

48
00:06:08.263 --> 00:06:20.973
moved; no one spoke. While the guests in the abbey tried to figure out what was going on,

49
00:06:20.974 --> 00:06:25.568
Edward and Tom stared at one another. Then Tom dropped to his knees in front of Edward and

50
