52
00:06:36.475 --> 00:06:42.060
an amazing resemblance," he thought. "These two could be taken for twins!" "Please do not find fault with

53
00:06:42.061 --> 00:06:50.546
me!" Tom pleaded with Edward. "I tried to explain to everyone what happened, but no one would believe

54
00:06:50.547 --> 00:07:00.548
